spans.s:
परि-√ चक्ष् Ā. -चष्टे (3. pl. -चक्षते; Pot. -चक्षीत Pass. -चक्ष्यते; Ved. inf. -च॑क्षि),
to overlook, pass over, despise, reject, Br.; Up.; BhP.;
to declare guilty, condemn, ŚBr.;
to forbid, Āpast.;
to mention, relate, own, acknowledge, MBh.;
to call, name, Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to address (acc.), answer, BhP.

परि-√ चर् P. -चरति (pf. -चचार ind.p. -चर्य), to move or walk about, go round (acc.), circumambulate, RV. &c. &c.;
to attend upon or to (acc., rarely gen.), serve, honour, ib. :
Caus. P. -चारयति (ind.p. -चार्य), to surround, Kauś.;
to wait on, attend to, Divyāv.;
to cohabit, ib.;
 (Ā. ˚ते), to be served or waited upon, ŚBr.; KaṭhUp.

Nom. P. ˚यति, to take a walk, roam about, SaddhP.;
to cohabit, Divyāv.;
to attend to, wait on ib.

परि-√ 1. चि P. Ā. -चिनोति, ˚नुते, to pile up, ŚBr.;
to surround or enclose with (instr.), Śulb.;
to heap up, accumulate, augment, increase, RV. &c. &c.:
Pass. -चीयते, to be increased or augmented, to grow, Ragh.

परि-√ चिन्त् P. -चिन्तयति (ind.p. -चिन्त्य), to think about, meditate on, reflect, consider, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to call to mind, remember, ib.;
to devise, invent, ib.

,
to cut on both sides, clip round, cut through or off or to pieces, mutilate, ŚBr.; Lāṭy.; MBh. &c.;
to mow or reap (corn), Kāraṇḍ.;
to limit on all sides, define or fix accurately, discriminate, decide, determine, Kāv.; Pañc.; Pur.;
to separate, divide, part, Siddh.;
to avert, obviate, MW.
